/**
 * @defgroup fs_stream_cr_api fs_stream CR API
 * @ingroup fs_stream_api
 *
 * @brief Composition Root (CR) API for the `fs_stream` adapter.
 *
 * @details
 * This API is intended to be used by the Composition Root only. It exposes
 * the types and services required to configure, construct, and register the
 * `fs_stream` adapter.
 *
 * Design notes:
 * - Runtime dependencies are injected through @ref fs_stream_env_t.
 * - Adapter descriptors are created through @ref fs_stream_create_desc.
 * - Stream instances are created through @ref fs_stream_create_stream.
 *
 * @note Runtime modules should not include this API directly.
 */
